{
 "irVersion": 1,
 "source": {
  "game": "battle_pentagram",
  "unit": "ext_pro_000_default",
  "textLang": "ja"
 },
 "title": "ext_pro_000_default",
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#000",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "………。",
   "voice": "40200010",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#001",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "（おかしい。さっきまでの時間軸の記憶が曖昧だわ…。）",
   "voice": "40200020",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#002",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "（ループするときに…何かあった？）",
   "voice": "40200030",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#003",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "（…そんなことを気にしても仕方ないわね。\nどうせ失敗したからここにいるだけのこと。）",
   "voice": "40200040",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#004",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "（そう、…思い出した。私に残された希望は１つだけ。）",
   "voice": "40200050",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#005",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "（「５人の魔法少女が協力して\n“ワルプルギスの夜”を倒す。」）",
   "voice": "40200060",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#006",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "（それがまどかが託してくれた、最後の願い…。）",
   "voice": "40200070",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#007",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "（彼女たちから協力関係を得る…そのためには…。）",
   "voice": "40200080",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#008",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "（やはり、“ワルプルギスの夜”が来ることを\n伝えるのが効果的かしら。）",
   "voice": "40200090",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#009",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "（巴マミと言えど、やつの存在は無視できないだろうし\n１人で立ち向かう相手でないことも理解しているはず。）",
   "voice": "40200100",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#010",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "（佐倉杏子も同じように\n見滝原に呼び寄せられそうだし…。）",
   "voice": "40200110",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#011",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "（…彼女たちを説得するためのデータが必要ね。）",
   "voice": "40200120",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#012",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "ティロ・フィナーレ！！",
   "voice": "40200130",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#013",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "ふう…これで終わりね。",
   "voice": "40200140",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#014",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "！？　誰？",
   "voice": "40200150",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#015",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "巴マミね？",
   "voice": "40200160",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#016",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "そうだけれど…どこかで会ったかしら？",
   "voice": "40200170",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#017",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "いいえ、初対面よ。",
   "voice": "40200180",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#018",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "その格好…。\n同業者だからご挨拶、といったところかしら？\nあいにく、この街の魔法少女は定員オーバーよ。",
   "voice": "40200190",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#019",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "別にあなたと縄張り争いをするつもりはないわ。\n私は、あなたと協力関係を築きたいだけ。",
   "voice": "40200200",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#020",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "協力関係ですって？",
   "voice": "40200210",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#021",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "１ヶ月後、この見滝原市に、\n“ワルプルギスの夜”が現れるわ。",
   "voice": "40200220",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#022",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "それを倒すための、戦力に加わって欲しいの。",
   "voice": "40200230",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#023",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "これはまた大きく出たわね…。\n私がそんな嘘に騙されると思う？",
   "voice": "40200240",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#024",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "“ワルプルギスの夜”がやってくるなんて話、\n聞いたことがないわ。",
   "voice": "40200250",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#025",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "証拠ならあるわ。",
   "voice": "40200260",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#026",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "…見せて頂戴。",
   "voice": "40200270",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#027",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "はあ…信じたくはないけれど、\n信じざるを得ないようね。",
   "voice": "40200280",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#028",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "話を聞く気になってくれたかしら？",
   "voice": "40200290",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#029",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "ええ。\nその前に１ついい？",
   "voice": "40200300",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#030",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "これだけの情報を持ちながら、どうして逃げないの？",
   "voice": "40200310",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#031",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "この街には守りたい人がいる。\nあなたにもあるでしょう？",
   "voice": "40200320",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#032",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "そう…ね。",
   "voice": "40200330",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#033",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "………。",
   "voice": "40200340",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#034",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "いいわ。わかったわ。\n結びましょう、協力関係を。",
   "voice": "40200350",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#035",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "そう言ってくれると助かるわ。",
   "voice": "40200360",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#036",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "暁美さん…と言ったかしら？\n実は、この街にはあと２人魔法少女がいるの。\nあなたに紹介しないといけないわね。",
   "voice": "40200370",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#037",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "元々このあと合流する予定だったから、\nそろそろ来ると思うけれど…。",
   "voice": "40200380",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#038",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目まどか",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "Chara_mdk"
   },
   "text": "マミさ～ん！",
   "voice": "40200390",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#039",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美樹さやか",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "Chara_syk"
   },
   "text": "すみません、遅くなっちゃいました～。",
   "voice": "40200400",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#040",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "鹿目まどかに、美樹さやか…。",
   "voice": "40200410",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#041",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目まどか",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "Chara_mdk"
   },
   "text": "え、ほむらちゃん！？",
   "voice": "40200420",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#042",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美樹さやか",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "Chara_syk"
   },
   "text": "あれ、“転校生”じゃん！",
   "voice": "40200430",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#043",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "なるほど…お互い自己紹介は必要ないみたいね。\nじゃあ、彼女たちにも説明するから、\n少しだけ待っててもらえるかしら？",
   "voice": "40200440",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#044",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "…構わないわ。",
   "voice": "40200450",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#045",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美樹さやか",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "Chara_syk"
   },
   "text": "“ワルプルギスの夜”ねぇ…。\nうあ～ん、つい最近魔法少女になったばかりなのに\n早くもピンチか、あたし～！",
   "voice": "40200460",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#046",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "だから、彼女と協力して戦うのよ。",
   "voice": "40200470",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#047",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目まどか",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "Chara_mdk"
   },
   "text": "それにしても、ほむらちゃんも魔法少女だったんだ。\nなんか、素敵な偶然だね。",
   "voice": "40200480",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#048",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "…そうね。",
   "voice": "40200490",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#049",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目まどか",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "Chara_mdk"
   },
   "text": "これからよろしくね、ほむらちゃん！",
   "voice": "40200500",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#050",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "よろしく、鹿目まどか。",
   "voice": "40200510",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#051",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "まだ釈然としないけど、心強いのも確かだわ。\nよろしくね、暁美さん。",
   "voice": "40200520",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#052",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美樹さやか",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "Chara_syk"
   },
   "text": "こんな危ない魔女、見逃せないしね。\nあたしも協力するわ、“転校生”。",
   "voice": "40200530",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#053",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "…よろしく、巴マミ、美樹さやか。",
   "voice": "40200540",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#054",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "最後に１つ。私からも協力者を紹介するわ。",
   "voice": "40200550",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#055",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "kyoko",
    "name": "佐倉杏子",
    "sourceId": 5,
    "code": "Chara_kyk"
   },
   "text": "ふんっ、随分ぞろぞろといやがるなぁ。",
   "voice": "40200560",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#056",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "kyoko",
    "name": "佐倉杏子",
    "sourceId": 5,
    "code": "Chara_kyk"
   },
   "text": "これで全員か、“イレギュラー”？",
   "voice": "40200570",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#057",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "ええ、そうよ。",
   "voice": "40200580",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#058",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美樹さやか",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "Chara_syk"
   },
   "text": "ちょっと“転校生”！\n誰なのよ、そいつ。",
   "voice": "40200590",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#059",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "彼女は佐倉杏子。\n巴マミも認める実力者よ。",
   "voice": "40200600",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#060",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "………。",
   "voice": "40200610",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#061",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "kyoko",
    "name": "佐倉杏子",
    "sourceId": 5,
    "code": "Chara_kyk"
   },
   "text": "ふぅん、あんたらが新人のヒヨッ子か。\n話は聞いてるぜ？\nしっかし、マミは相変わらずお人よしだねぇ。",
   "voice": "40200620",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#062",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "そうかもしれないわね…。",
   "voice": "40200630",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#063",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目まどか",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "Chara_mdk"
   },
   "text": "２人は、お知り合いなんですか？",
   "voice": "40200640",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#064",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "kyoko",
    "name": "佐倉杏子",
    "sourceId": 5,
    "code": "Chara_kyk"
   },
   "text": "まぁ、ちょっと昔にな。",
   "voice": "40200650",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#065",
   "kind": "monologue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "………。",
   "voice": "40200660",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#066",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "これで、全員の顔合わせが済んだわね。",
   "voice": "40200670",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#067",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "暁美さん、確認になるんだけれど。",
   "voice": "40200680",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#068",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "何？",
   "voice": "40200690",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#069",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴マミ",
    "sourceId": 3,
    "code": "Chara_mam"
   },
   "text": "“ワルプルギスの夜”が現れるまでの１ヶ月、\n暁美さんと佐倉さんが、私たちと協力して、\nこの街の魔女と戦ってくれるのよね？",
   "voice": "40200700",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#070",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "ええ、そうよ。",
   "voice": "40200710",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#071",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "とにかくどんな手を使ってでも、全員で力を合わせて\n“ワルプルギスの夜”は倒さなければならないから…！",
   "voice": "40200720",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#072",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目まどか",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "Chara_mdk"
   },
   "text": "わわっ、ほむらちゃんすっごいやる気。",
   "voice": "40200730",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#073",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美樹さやか",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "Chara_syk"
   },
   "text": "それだけやっばい相手ってことなの…？",
   "voice": "40200740",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#074",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "homura",
    "name": "暁美ほむら",
    "sourceId": 4,
    "code": "Chara_hmr"
   },
   "text": "ええ。…力を貸してもらえたら助かるわ。",
   "voice": "40200750",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "ext_pro_000_default#075",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目まどか",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "Chara_mdk"
   },
   "text": "わかったよほむらちゃん！　一緒に魔女を倒そう！！\n明日からよろしくね、みんな！！",
   "voice": "40200760",
   "cues": []
  }
 ]
}